        {
            "location": "16/UI",
            "narrator": "OptionWindow/Panel/Scroll View/Viewport/Content/Panel_I_D3/TextCap",
            "text": "値を小さくするほど、フリックとして認識されやすくなります。",
            "zh": "数值越小，越容易被识别为滑动。",
            "narrator_zh": "OptionWindow/Panel/Scroll View/Viewport/Content/Panel_I_D3/TextCap"
